      "created": 1794352100253,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Simple to use \n- Popular easy to build.\n- JSON format\n- Weakness - Real-time live data inefficient\n- Weakness - Web of relationships inefficient\n- Issue - over fetching and under fetching data.",
      "fontSize": 40.26666666666666,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Simple to use \n- Popular easy to build.\n- JSON format\n- Weakness - Real-time live data inefficient\n- Weakness - Web of relationships inefficient\n- Issue - over fetching and under fetching data.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
