      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Fixes the issue of under and over fetching data\n- Flexible data query. Minimal data transfer.\n- Complex data relationships\n- Communication faster and efficient\n- Overkill for simple application\n- More processing work on server side.",
